@startuml 服务端设计包图
' 胡豪 · 第二阶段设计 · 技术分包与装配
' 对应代码：server/src/main/java/edu/pkmon/；与 系统模块包图（分析）对应，
' 新增内容为：common 内部三个子包、自动配置装配方式、外部组件（Flyway/H2）
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #F5F8FB
  BorderColor #6F97B8
  FontColor #1F2A37
}
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #6F97B8
}

package "edu.pkmon.demo" as DemoPkg {
  [PkmonApplication\n启动类（主责：胡豪）\n组件扫描仅本包] as App
}

package "edu.pkmon.common（主责：胡豪）" as CommonPkg {
  [api\nApiResponse 统一信封] as CApi
  [error\nGlobalExceptionHandler 兜底] as CErr
  [config\nCommonConfig 装配\nStartupCheckRunner 启动检查] as CConf
}

package "edu.pkmon.capture（主责：孙虹毅）" as CapturePkg {
  [web\nController] as CWeb
  [service\nCaptureService 等] as CSvc
  [repository\n接口 + memory 替身] as CRepo
  [config\nCaptureConfig 装配] as Cfg
}

package "edu.pkmon.user（待建：闫昕）" as UserPkg
package "edu.pkmon.study（待建：董欣毓/赵冠钧）" as StudyPkg

package "外部组件" as Ext {
  [Spring Boot\n自动配置机制] as Boot
  [Flyway\n版本化迁移] as Flyway
  database "H2\n默认内存库 / dev 文件库" as H2
}

App --> Boot : 启动
Boot --> CConf : AutoConfiguration.imports\n（CommonConfig 排在 CaptureConfig 前）
Boot --> Cfg : 自动配置注册
CConf ..> CApi : 装配
CConf ..> CErr : 装配
CWeb --> CSvc
CSvc --> CRepo
CRepo ..> H2 : 实现替换后走真库\n（当前为内存替身，接口不变）
CConf --> Flyway : 触发 migrate()
Flyway --> H2 : 应用 V1+

note right of CConf
  Clock 等公共 Bean 全部
  @ConditionalOnMissingBean：
  测试可替换固定时钟，
  与 capture 原 captureClock 不冲突
end note

note bottom of UserPkg
  user / study 包建立后按同一方式
  装配公共 Bean，不修改启动类
end note
@enduml
